editorial_contributions.text:
The articles of this volume will be announced individually.


From the preface: ``This Proceedings collects 94 papers which were presented at the First Asian Mathematical Conference held in Hong Kong, August 14-18, 1990. The First Asian Mathematical Conference was jointly organized by the Southeast Asian Mathematical Society and Hong Kong Mathematical Society in collaboration with many Asian mathematical societies from China, Japan, Taiwan, Korea, India, Pakistan, Mongolia, Russia, and Bangladesh.''


